# Pipeline v2 is locked

The canonical Pipeline v2 is protected by `.codeme/pipeline-lock.json`.

- Do not modify any protected pipeline file unless the repository owner explicitly authorizes a pipeline change in the current conversation/task.
- Do not update lock hashes just to make CI green.
- If an add-on appears to require a protected-file change, stop and ask for permission first.
- Prefer extension points: external MCP tools, capabilities, providers, UI modules, adapters, and new packages.
- After an explicitly approved pipeline change, run the full qualification suite and deliberately refresh the lock baseline.

The frozen restore point is branch `pipeline-v2-locked-baseline`.
